Package: RSYC
Title: Remote Sensing-Derived Yield Curves for Canada
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(
    person(given = "Piotr", 
           family = "Tompalski",
           email = "piotr.tompalski@NRCan-RNCan.gc.ca",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")))
Description: Provides published remote sensing-based yield curves for
    aboveground biomass and total volume across Canada. Models are available
    for 150 km tiles and nested ecological strata at national and regional
    scales, with tools for prediction and model discovery.
